WEBVTT

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.720
<b>Yo, yo, yonaka ni bakko suru chimi mouryou</b>

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:27.720
<i>Yo, yo, at midnight evil spirits stalk</i>

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.800
<b>Marude ikaino ichimi routou</b>

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.800
<i>As if they're from another world</i>

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.010
<b>Mitai na rhymer rhyme shini toujou</b>

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.010
<i>Come to rhyme rhymes</i>

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.180
<b>Kikoetarou? Yamini hibiku oto</b>

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.180
<i>Can you hear them? The sounds resonating from the darkness</i>

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.520
<b>Bibitte kyomi nai furi shiyouto</b>

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.520
<i>Scared senseless, but you pretend not to be interested</i>

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.480
<b>Koukishin wa hini hini jyoushou</b>

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.480
<i>Your curiosity grows day by day</i>

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.770
<b>Nara check shini ikou, here we, here we go ya'll!</b>

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.770
<i>So let's go check them out, here we, here we go ya'll</i>

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.980
<b>Ayashi ayaushi shima no chimi mouryou</b>

00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:42.980
<i>The mysterious and dangerous evil spirits</i>

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:44.650
<b>Tabun jigoku wa manpai</b>

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:44.650
<i>Hell is probably full with evil spirits</i>

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.940
<b>Afure dashita renchuu ga dantai de retsu wo nashite</b>

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.940
<i>Those that can't get in march in a line</i>

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.150
<b>Kono yo ni stand-by</b>

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.150
<i>Waiting on stand-by in this world</i>

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.360
<b>Yatsura no bun basho ga mazu tannai</b>

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.360
<i>There aren't any spaces left for them</i>

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.620
<b>Dooride kisetsu towazu atsui hazu</b>

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.620
<i>No wonder, no matter what the season is, it's always hot</i>

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:56.240
<b>Aete heat up sasu ikatsui verse wo</b>

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:56.240
<i>Purposely heating you up with hot verses</i>

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.950
<b>Kamashite ase kakasuzo</b>

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.950
<i>That make you sweat</i>

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.710
<b>Douse yakedaro kikasena gasshou wo yo!</b>

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:00.710
<i>You might as well let us hear you all sing!</i>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.790
<b>HA! Koitsuwa marude kajiba</b>

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.790
<i>HA! It's just like a scene of a fire</i>

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.170
<b>Sugee nekki tamacchimau shimaguni</b>

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.170
<i>The excitement in the air heats up this island country</i>

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.300
<b>DANGER! Masu masu agacchimau COME ON!</b>

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.300
<i>DANGER! The tension keeps building COME ON!</i>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.550
<b>(Kono Jipangu mouchoi de panku!)</b>

00:01:07.460 --> 00:01:09.550
<i>(This Japan is about to explode!)</i>

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.680
<b>HA! Koitsuwa marude kajiba</b>

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.680
<i>HA! It's just like a scene of a fire</i>

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.970
<b>Sugee nekki tamacchimau shimaguni</b>

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:13.970
<i>The excitement in the air heats up this island country</i>

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.180
<b>DANGER! Masu masu agacchimau COME ON!</b>

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:16.180
<i>DANGER! The tension keeps building COME ON!</i>

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.390
<b>(Kono Jipangu mouchoi de panku!)</b>

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.390
<i>(This Japan is about to explode!)</i>

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.400
Lady Oiwa...

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:35.030
It has been 180 years
since you laid your curse,

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:37.410
and yet it still persists.

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:42.960
Does your hatred run that deep?

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:47.300
Featuring you as the main character,
the Kabuki play

00:01:47.380 --> 00:01:50.050
<i>"Tokaido Yotsuya Kaidan"</i>

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:53.010
has been remarkably well received.

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:54.720
However...

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:20.290
Come on in, folks!

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.960
Year 8 - Bunsei Era

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.460
You don't want to miss it!

00:02:35.180 --> 00:02:38.850
I was known as
Tsuruya Nanboku the Fourth.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:42.350
But my real name is Katsu Hyozo.

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.560
I curse you, lemon!

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:53.150
Act One

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:59.330
Up until then, I had written many
gruesome tales for the stage.

00:02:59.530 --> 00:03:04.160
Yet none of my tales
were so horrifying as to make

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:07.580
the audience regret that
they'd seen it.

00:03:08.420 --> 00:03:10.750
I was 71 years old.

00:03:11.090 --> 00:03:16.550
There was only so much time left
in my life to write new stories.

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:22.600
My longing to create a story
that was truly terrifying,

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.100
was the hunger that urged me on.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:29.520
So, from the rumors
of a ghost named Oiwa,

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.940
I fabricated my story.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:34.610
But the truth is...

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:40.660
Perhaps I was being possessed
to write the story.

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:44.870
Over there!

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.250
Yes, I see it! There!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.790
Quick, release the hawk!

00:03:47.870 --> 00:03:49.380
Let it go!

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:50.880
Go!

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.020
Good grief, it's just a rat.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:07.730
We can't eat that!

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:24.620
Lady Oiwa...

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.460
Yes, Osode.
I'll be right there.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:42.470
The main characters
of this horrifying, cruel story,

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:45.430
Tamiya lemon and Oiwa,

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:48.640
were happy before
they exchanged marriage vows

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:51.270
and were blessed with a child.

00:04:58.280 --> 00:05:03.030
However, the samurai of the
Ako Domain gathered here

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:06.490
fell from grace after
the death of their lord,

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:09.120
and became ronin,
or samurai for hire.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:16.420
lemon's lord, Asano Takumi-no-Kami
had attempted,

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:19.800
but failed to kill
Kira Kozuke-no-Suke

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.130
in a corridor of Edo Castle.

00:05:22.390 --> 00:05:25.470
As such, Takumi-no-Kami was
ordered to commit seppuku.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:29.520
It was then rumored that the
now masterless samurai of Ako

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:32.520
would seek revenge against
Kira for their master.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:37.400
Yes, the Tokaido Yotsuya Kaidan

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:41.450
was presented against the backdrop
of the story of ''Chushingura''.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:51.830
Miss,

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:55.380
I'm sure you'll receive good fortune
and that man will take your hand.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:05:59.760
You bastard, who gave you
permission to beg here?!

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:02.970
Are you moving in on us?!

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.470
I'm very sorry.

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:07.310
Please forgive me.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:09.140
Forgive you?!

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:10.980
You've got to be kidding, old man!

00:06:15.770 --> 00:06:17.900
Hand over the money
you made here!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:18.940
Ow, ow, ow...!

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:20.570
Who the hell are you?

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:23.490
Tamiya lemon!

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:25.910
That's enough.

00:06:25.990 --> 00:06:27.240
What did you say?

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:28.950
Stay out of this, ronin!

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:38.130
Tamiya lemon!

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:43.170
M-Miss?!

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.050
What is it, Oume?!

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:51.310
Father-in-law, you're not injured?

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:54.100
Your relations with Oiwa
have been severed.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.440
I am no longer your father-in-law.

00:06:56.690 --> 00:06:59.610
But Oiwa and I are deeply in love.

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:02.400
And she's also carrying my child.

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:05.450
It must be fate
that I saved you today.

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.660
Won't you return Oiwa to me?

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:12.870
I refuse to hand over my daughter
to a bandit like you!

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:15.460
Is that how you think of me?

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:19.630
Before our domain was dissolved,
someone stole the money from it.

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:23.210
It had to have been you,
Tamiya lemon.

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:25.590
What proof do you have?

00:07:25.970 --> 00:07:28.640
The dowry money
you offered for my daughter

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:31.350
had the domain's seal on it.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:35.980
If our lord were alive,
you would've been beheaded!

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:40.690
Although I may have been
reduced to begging,

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:44.110
I will not allow my daughter
to be married to a scoundrel.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.280
Excuse me.

00:07:47.950 --> 00:07:49.780
Ignorant,

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.790
foolish man!

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:59.250
Five mon each! Cures anything!

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:02.340
Well, if it isn't Naosuke,
the medicine peddler.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:04.420
Osode's no longer here.

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:05.380
What?

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:08.050
She said she was starting work
at another place today.

00:08:08.130 --> 00:08:09.510
And where would that be?

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:11.680
At Takuetsu's place.

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:13.470
The Jigoku Brothel?

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.850
So Osode's become a prostitute.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:26.110
Which would you like,
the small or the large?

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:28.950
Oh, I'm not here
for a moxa treatment.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:32.990
I came here to see about a woman.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:36.000
You have a new one called Osode,
from Yojiya, right?

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.540
Indeed. See yourself
to the back.

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:44.210
Please excuse me.

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:46.590
Good evening.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.930
Hey, Osode.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:53.470
You!

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.180
Yes, I'm Naosuke.

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:57.730
I used to work as a man servant
for the Yotsuya family.

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:59.350
How'd you know I was here?

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:01.400
Osode, you know something?

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:04.900
I've always been
taken by your striking beauty.

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:06.610
Come! Over here!

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:08.990
How dare you be so vulgar!

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:13.030
My family has fallen from grace,
but I'm still the daughter of a samurai.

00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.160
I will not be touched
by a mere servant.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:16.700
What an attitude!

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:18.250
Stay still!

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.380
Is that you, Osode?

00:09:24.420 --> 00:09:25.590
Yomoshichi

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:27.170
what are you doing here?

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.210
Stop!

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:30.420
I'm a customer here!

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:33.430
You're Sato Yomoshichi.

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:34.550
Naosuke?

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:36.510
Why are you treating
Osode like this?!

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:38.720
Damn you!

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:41.730
Ow...!

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:43.270
Damn!

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:45.440
You'll regret this!

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.110
Are you all right, Osode?

00:09:48.820 --> 00:09:51.280
To think you're working
in a place like this.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:54.370
Have you already
forgotten about me?

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:56.200
What a terrible thing to say.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:10:00.160
You've already asked me
for my hand in marriage.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:04.290
It's shameful to see you
come to a place like this.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:07.380
You're right.
I have no excuse.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.970
But I'm working
as a trader these days,

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:13.180
and even doing business
with people in town.

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:16.640
One day I will come
and take you away.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.220
Yomoshichi.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.770
Yomoshichi, you bastard.

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:26.310
I'm not going to let this go.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:37.490
After being forced by her father
to separate from lemon,

00:10:37.910 --> 00:10:39.120
lemon...

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:43.500
Oiwa was not able to forget him.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.870
Tamiya lemon!

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:33.760
Not only have you
separated me from Oiwa,

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.550
you've called me a bandit!

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.840
Still pretending to be innocent?!

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:40.300
How pathetic you've
already become.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:42.220
Doddering old fool!

00:11:50.270 --> 00:11:53.400
Damn you, Tamiya lemon!

00:11:58.410 --> 00:11:59.950
Die!

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.080
That'll teach you, Yomoshichi!

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:12.000
Serves you right.

00:12:13.050 --> 00:12:14.260
Who's there?!

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:15.880
I've seen your face.

00:12:16.470 --> 00:12:17.760
Master Tamiya!

00:12:17.800 --> 00:12:18.880
Naosuke?!

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:20.260
You killed him?

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:22.680
Yeah. I had a score to settle.

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:24.180
Score to settle?

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.640
With who?

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:28.560
Sato Yomoshichi.

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:31.310
But I cut up his face so bad,

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:33.270
no one will recognize him.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:35.480
I guess.

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:37.110
And that pathetic man...

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:39.410
You killed a man, too, Master?

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:40.320
Yeah.

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:41.780
Yotsuya Samon.

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:42.490
What?

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:45.120
But isn't he your father-in-law?

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:47.450
Naosuke, bring that body
over this way.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:48.620
Sure.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:52.040
Lady Oiwa?

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:53.130
Osode?

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.050
What are you doing here?

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:58.420
It's late and father hasn't returned,
so I've come to look for him.

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:00.930
Did he stop by the Yojiya?

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:02.930
I no longer work there.

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.430
He's trouble even when he's dead.

00:13:06.890 --> 00:13:08.520
But what's the point of this?

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:11.730
To lead people to think
they were killed by bandits.

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:13.810
Besides, being together like this,

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:16.480
they have each other's company
on their way to the other side.

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:18.360
If you say so.

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:19.820
Someone's coming!

00:13:25.370 --> 00:13:26.540
Is that your father?!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.670
Oh, Father!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:34.840
Father!

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:36.670
Father!

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:41.010
I've seen those clothes.
Don't tell me that's...!

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.260
Yomoshichi!

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:44.010
Your face!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:46.060
How cruel!

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:47.930
Father!

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:49.140
Father!

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.390
Oiwa! Is that you, Oiwa?

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:54.520
Oh, lemon!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.020
It's my father!

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:57.480
Father-in-law?!

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:01.950
Who could've done this?!

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:07.620
What are you doing?

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:08.910
Please let go.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:12.250
This life is nothing
but hardship and suffering.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.710
I'd rather join my father in death!

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:18.630
If you take your own life now,
who will avenge your father's death?

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:22.050
We may be separated,
but we are still husband and wife.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.720
I will avenge his death with you.

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.770
lemon!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.310
Osode, I want to be of help to you.

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:39.020
But Naosuke, you are...

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:41.150
Seeing as what's happened
in the past,

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.450
I may well be accused of this.

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:46.870
That's why I want to avenge
Yomoshichi's death.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:48.580
To prove my innocence.

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:52.080
But you aren't my husband,
or related to me at all.

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.500
So, until his death is avenged,

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.580
we must pretend
to be husband and wife.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:00.210
Of course I won't lay
a hand on you,

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:02.130
and we'll sleep in separate rooms.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:04.340
Even if we're only pretending,

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:08.300
I want to seek revenge together,
as husband and wife.

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:10.560
Osode?

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.600
Very well, then.

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:19.230
In a rice paddy behind Asakusa
Temple lay two corpses

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:22.820
along with two unlikely couples
in a sad embrace.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:26.700
What a cruel thing fate is.

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:30.990
Time passed and the seasons
came and went.

00:15:31.790 --> 00:15:36.620
lemon had wanted so badly
to be together with his Oiwa.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:45.380
But with the birth of their child,
his interest in her quickly waned.

00:15:49.850 --> 00:15:54.310
The manservant I recommended,
Kohei, has run away.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:57.310
Not only did he leave,
he also stole something as well.

00:15:57.900 --> 00:16:00.270
What on earth did he steal?

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:04.150
A medicine called Soukisei
that's been kept in the Tamiya family.

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:09.990
Lady Oiwa's health has been poor
ever since she gave birth.

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.710
How irritating! Make him stop!

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:24.510
How inconsiderate to have a baby
in these impoverished conditions.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.010
You're going out?

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:32.680
Where to?

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:34.060
You don't need to know.

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:38.140
Please come home quickly.

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:18.060
Tamiya lemon...

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:20.100
Miss?

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:32.490
I wonder where
your father has gone?

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:55.640
Tamiya!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:00.270
Chobei, you've caught
Kohei for me?

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:01.480
I'm sorry!

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:03.060
I'm so sorry, Master Tamiya!

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.110
Is this the medicine
that was stolen from you?

00:18:06.150 --> 00:18:07.980
Yes, this is the Soukisei.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.320
So Kohei,

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:11.650
what were you planning
on doing with my medicine?

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:12.610
Well,

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:15.320
my former master is terribly ill

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:17.080
and can't move at all.

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.950
I thought the Soukisei
would surely cure him.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:21.540
I'm so very sorry!

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:25.420
Even so, it doesn't justify
stealing and running away.

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:26.710
What'll you do?

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:28.090
Let's see.

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:31.840
How about we break
all ten of his fingers for a start?

00:18:32.470 --> 00:18:34.590
Yeah, that's a pretty good idea.

00:18:34.640 --> 00:18:36.090
Oh, please forgive me!

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:36.970
Please!

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.430
- Shut up!
- Forgive me!

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.850
Chobei, keep him quiet.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:42.980
Right.

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:05.960
Excuse me?

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:10.590
Excuse me?

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:11.670
Coming.

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.800
Yes, may I ask who's calling?

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:17.550
Stop wriggling around!

00:19:19.970 --> 00:19:21.010
Quiet in there!

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:23.020
Who is it?

00:19:23.310 --> 00:19:26.310
Says she's a maid
from the nearby House of Ito.

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:28.190
My name is Maki.

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:32.030
What business do you
have with me?

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:35.530
I am here to congratulate you
on your wife's safe delivery.

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:36.700
Bring it.

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:39.910
That's very kind of you.

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:41.370
And this.

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:47.830
A medicine that my master, Ito Kihei,
asked me to bring you.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:51.130
It's good for the postpartum
recovery period.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:53.510
Please have your wife try it.

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.720
Thank him for his generosity.

00:19:57.760 --> 00:20:01.010
Please Master Tamiya,
I hope you'll honor the Ito Family

00:20:01.100 --> 00:20:03.600
with a visit sometime.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:06.440
I will come to pay my respects.

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:09.190
Then we'll be looking forward
to you calling.

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:33.920
Lady Oiwa, I have your medicine
here for you.

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:40.930
The fate of Oiwa and lemon
had finally started to play out,

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:44.970
leading them on a downward spiral
with no path for return.

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:54.980
What tragedy will
this medicine bring?

00:20:57.570 --> 00:21:00.490
That will be revealed
in the next act.

